*> The random sources of the loot engine (T0436; docs/protocol/26-loot-and-predicates.md section 4, 10 section 2): Xoroshiro128++ with the
*> 128-bit seeding of 10 2.2 and the named sequences of 26 section 4 step 5, and the Java LCG of explicit seeds (10 2.6). The state is
*> LOOT-WORK (core/copy/LOOTSTATE.cpy). 64-bit words are BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED: sums and products run in COMPUTE's wide intermediate
*> precision and are reduced modulo 2^64 (constants in PIC 9(20) VALUE items), xor is CBL_XOR over the eight bytes.
*> Not modelled: a generator whose both words are zero (replaced by the golden/silver ratio words in 10 2.1; no seed produces it).
*> Entry points:
*>   LOOT-RNG-SEED-128 USING seed (BINARY-DOUBLE), use key (BINARY-LONG 1 or 0), key low, key high (BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED)
*>     Xoroshiro from a 64-bit seed: lo = seed xor 0x6A09E667F3BCC909, hi = lo + 0x9E3779B97F4A7C15, both xor the key words when
*>     use key is 1, then mixStafford13 of each (10 2.2; section 4 step 5 with the key words of seedForKey)
*>   LOOT-KEY-HASH USING key (PIC X(112)), low, high out (BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED): seedFromHashOf (MD5, big-endian words, 10 2.4)
*>   LOOT-RNG-SEED-SEQUENCE USING key (PIC X(112)), world seed (BINARY-DOUBLE): the named sequence of the id, created from the world
*>     seed and the salt on first use, else continued from its stored state
*>   LOOT-RNG-SAVE                      stores the state of a sequence roll back into its row
*>   LOOT-RNG-SEED-LCG USING seed       the Java LCG of an explicit seed
*>   LOOT-RNG-LONG USING value out (BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED)    Xoroshiro nextLong
*>   LOOT-RNG-INT USING bound (BINARY-LONG, 1 or more), result out    nextInt(bound) of the current source
*>   LOOT-RNG-FLOAT USING result out (FLOAT-LONG)    nextFloat: a multiple of 2^-24 below 1
*>   LOOT-RNG-BOOL USING result out (BINARY-LONG 1 or 0)    nextBoolean

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LOOT-MIX64.
*> USING word (BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED, in and out): mixStafford13 (10 2.2).
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-P64                 PIC 9(20) VALUE 18446744073709551616.
 01 WS-P30                 PIC 9(20) VALUE 1073741824.
 01 WS-P27                 PIC 9(20) VALUE 134217728.
 01 WS-P31                 PIC 9(20) VALUE 2147483648.
 01 WS-M1                  BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED VALUE 13787848793156543929.
 01 WS-M2                  BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED VALUE 10723151780598845931.
 01 WS-SHIFT               BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-WORD                 BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-WORD.
     COMPUTE WS-SHIFT = L-WORD / WS-P30
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING WS-SHIFT L-WORD BY VALUE 8
     COMPUTE L-WORD = FUNCTION MOD(L-WORD * WS-M1, WS-P64)
     COMPUTE WS-SHIFT = L-WORD / WS-P27
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING WS-SHIFT L-WORD BY VALUE 8
     COMPUTE L-WORD = FUNCTION MOD(L-WORD * WS-M2, WS-P64)
     COMPUTE WS-SHIFT = L-WORD / WS-P31
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING WS-SHIFT L-WORD BY VALUE 8
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM LOOT-MIX64.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LOOT-RNG-SEED-128.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY LOOTSTATE.
 01 WS-P64                 PIC 9(20) VALUE 18446744073709551616.
 01 WS-SILVER              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED VALUE 7640891576956012809.
 01 WS-GOLDEN              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED VALUE 11400714819323198485.
 01 WS-UNSIGNED            BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-SEED                 BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 L-USE-KEY              BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-KEY-LO               BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 L-KEY-HI               BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-SEED L-USE-KEY L-KEY-LO L-KEY-HI.
     COMPUTE WS-UNSIGNED = FUNCTION MOD(L-SEED, WS-P64)
     CALL "CBL_XOR" USING WS-SILVER WS-UNSIGNED BY VALUE 8
     MOVE WS-UNSIGNED TO LW-LO
     COMPUTE LW-HI = FUNCTION MOD(LW-LO + WS-GOLDEN, WS-P64)
     IF L-USE-KEY = 1
         CALL "CBL_XOR" USING L-KEY-LO LW-LO BY VALUE 8
         CALL "CBL_XOR" USING L-KEY-HI LW-HI BY VALUE 8
     END-IF
     CALL "LOOT-MIX64" USING LW-LO
     CALL "LOOT-MIX64" USING LW-HI
     MOVE 1 TO LW-KIND
     MOVE 0 TO LW-SEQ
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM LOOT-RNG-SEED-128.

