 PROGRAM-ID. LOOT-KEY-HASH.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-DATA                PIC X(112).
 01 WS-DATA-LENGTH         BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-DIGEST              PIC X(64).
 01 WS-DIGEST-LENGTH       BINARY-LONG UNSIGNED.
 01 WS-ALGORITHM           USAGE POINTER.
 01 WS-ENGINE              USAGE POINTER VALUE NULL.
 01 WS-RC                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BYTE                BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-KEY                  PIC X(112).
 01 L-LO                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 L-HI                   BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-KEY L-LO L-HI.
     MOVE L-KEY TO WS-DATA
     COMPUTE WS-DATA-LENGTH = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(L-KEY TRAILING))
     CALL STATIC "EVP_md5" RETURNING WS-ALGORITHM
     CALL STATIC "EVP_Digest" USING BY REFERENCE WS-DATA BY VALUE WS-DATA-LENGTH
         BY REFERENCE WS-DIGEST BY REFERENCE WS-DIGEST-LENGTH BY VALUE WS-ALGORITHM
         BY VALUE WS-ENGINE RETURNING WS-RC
     MOVE 0 TO L-LO L-HI
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 8
         COMPUTE WS-BYTE = FUNCTION ORD(WS-DIGEST(WS-I:1)) - 1
         COMPUTE L-LO = L-LO * 256 + WS-BYTE
         COMPUTE WS-BYTE = FUNCTION ORD(WS-DIGEST(WS-I + 8:1)) - 1
         COMPUTE L-HI = L-HI * 256 + WS-BYTE
     END-PERFORM
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM LOOT-KEY-HASH.

